      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LENNY'S HONEY (8) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.3 lengths at this track in a handy 16.95 beating Rippin' Pedro. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Can make it two on the bounce. SECRET SUPER (6) had a wide draw last time when running fourth (17.01) over 300m at Murray Bridge in a Grade 3/4/5. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Key runner on best form. BEAST CUT LOOSE (1) boasts a strong record this journey here with 25 wins and 23 minors from 57 tries. Placed last time (17.05) at this track in a OPEN, finishing third and beaten 1.5 lengths. Looks one of the chances. STIFLER (4) was well fancied last time on the strength of his recent form but could only manage third (17.33) at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with six wins and four minor placings from 12 starts. Racing well and deserves a win.",
